{"id": "62611", "title": "独家承宠", "author": "北萧瑟", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 31, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/62/62611.htm", "intro": "“晚晚，在我见过的所有女人里，你不算顶漂亮的，也不算最可爱的，更不是聪明伶俐的，”他复低头看她几眼，她已经委屈死了，可他不急不慢的继续说道：“甚至有些笨手笨脚的。”\r\n“萧亦澜你太可恶了！现在悔婚行不行？”\r\n他低头亲她，她没逃开，他覆在她唇上说：“不行。”\r\n她正要开口和他闹腾，却听他说：“可是，在我眼里我怎么就觉得我的晚晚比所有姑娘都漂亮可爱呢，我只想要你给我生的孩子，我只想要你做我萧亦澜的老婆。晚晚，现在，你还想悔婚吗？”\r\n“从现在开始，我要你陪我走往后所有的路，不管是平坦大道还是荆棘小路，我都要你陪着我，萧亦澜，你做得到吗？”\r\n可是晚晚，若是有一天你反悔现在所说的每句话每个字，该怎么办？\r\n我愿意陪你一直走下去，但最怕的，不过是你不愿再让我陪着你走。", "base": "files/article/html/62/62611", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "9295838.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-13", "file": "9295840.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14-21", "file": "9295841.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-29", "file": "9295844.html", "available": false}, {"title": "30-38", "file": "9295845.html", "available": false}, {"title": "39-48", "file": "9295846.html", "available": false}, {"title": "49-58", "file": "9295850.html", "available": false}, {"title": "59-69", "file": "9295852.html", "available": false}, {"title": "70-80", "file": "9295854.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-91", "file": "9295857.html", "available": false}, {"title": "92-102", "file": "9295858.html", "available": false}, {"title": "103-113", "file": "9295859.html", "available": false}, {"title": "114-124", "file": "9295861.html", "available": false}, {"title": "125-133", "file": "9295863.html", "available": false}, {"title": "134-143", "file": "9295865.html", "available": false}, {"title": "144-153", "file": "9295867.html", "available": false}, {"title": "154-163", "file": "9295869.html", "available": false}, {"title": "164-172", "file": "9295871.html", "available": false}, {"title": "173-176", "file": "9295873.html", "available": false}, {"title": "177-180", "file": "9295875.html", "available": false}, {"title": "181-184", "file": "9295877.html", "available": false}, {"title": "185-188", "file": "9295879.html", "availa